{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/join_discord.png?t=1748888336\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Triangle - Cursed Town</strong> is a 4-player online co-op atmospheric horror game. You and your friends are a team sent by the church. Together, you will enter the cursed village, try to collect as much evidence as possible, and complete the necessary ritual to lift the curse. The tools you find in the village will help you learn about the type of demon you're dealing with and uncover the mystery behind the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/Comp_1_1.gif?t=1748888336\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Experience:\u00a0</strong>Get ready for an intense and chilling experience with gripping visuals, eerie atmospheric sounds, and a minimal interface that pulls you into the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/oyun_i\u00e7i.gif?t=1748888336\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tools &amp; Equipments:\u00a0</strong>Use your equipment to interact with the demon, collect clues, and discover what kind of entity you're facing. Gather the required items, complete the ritual, and cleanse the village of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/esyalar_v1.gif?t=1748888336\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cursed Town</strong>: Remember, this village is cursed by someone. Your duty is to restore the sanctity of this village and find out who caused this curse or not. Explore the village with your friends and solve its mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/k\u00f6y.gif?t=1748888336\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266950?t=1748888336","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266950?t=1748888336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/47e4979fec490b3dfbf75402a3600355dac3f68c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748888336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/47e4979fec490b3dfbf75402a3600355dac3f68c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748888336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/join_discord.png?t=1748888336\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Triangle - Cursed Town</strong> is a 4-player online co-op atmospheric horror game. You and your friends are a team sent by the church. Together, you will enter the cursed village, try to collect as much evidence as possible, and c